          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Irbirch",
            text: _("Bwahaha, when did you Whitefangs become so weak as to follow the ploy of a spy? Blackcrest warriors would never have let humans advance so far into our lands!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ushka'e",
            text: _("Your “warriors” only survive by cowering behind your slimy lizard allies! But since Clan Blackcrest has begged so-like trembling goblins, Clan Whitefang will agree to work together."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Irbirch",
            text: _("Since WE begged!? YOU invited US here; your messenger was quaking in his boots when he groveled before Chief Ghuvog asking for help!"),
