            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Surrounded and absent the queen; this is a disaster! Quick, we must rally what’s left of the crown’s infantry. Send a detachment to rescue Queen Asheviere, and have the rest protect King Garard until Lionel and Arand can break through to us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I won’t let you down! For Wesnoth!"),
          },
