      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_87",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("This alliance between races is a great ill fortune! I’ve oft known orcs to recruit trolls, but seldom saurians. And with these three factions fighting together, soon all the warlords will hear of their prowess."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("It takes a great show of strength to unite the fractious orcs, but after this disaster countless more will surely flock to the Blackcrest and Whitefang banners. Orcs follow might above all else, even clan blood."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("Utter madness, all of this! The orcish clans are a hornet’s nest that should never have been kicked. Pillagers and raids we can deal with, but total war is something else entirely."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Quiet, both of you! If I wanted your advice I would have asked for it!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
